{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>無綫小花黃紫恩近日在社交平台罕有公開多張少女時期舊照，自揭當年曾因外貌受盡冷言冷語及嚴重欺凌。她將昔日被嘲笑的殘酷經歷化作蛻變動力，並以日前出席《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》的明艷造型作出反擊。這段充滿反差感的成長對比短片瞬間引爆網絡熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>黃紫恩公開學生時期青澀舊照</h2>\n<p>從黃紫恩上載至社交平台的成長對比短片可見，學生時期的她留著極為厚重瀏海並配戴粗框眼鏡，身穿校服或簡樸便服對鏡頭展露靦腆笑容。當時造型相當樸素青澀，與現時螢光幕前亮麗形象完全判若兩人。她在這批舊照上特意加上英文字句，坦率道出成長路上曾面對外貌嘲笑與無情打擊，將昔日遭受欺凌真實情況毫無保留地呈現在大眾眼前。</p>\n<h2>穿戰衣現身《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》</h2>\n<p>面對過去種種惡意批評，黃紫恩選擇以實際行動及最佳狀態作出回應。短片尾段隨即接上她日前出席《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》現場畫面，當晚她換上一襲純白色平口馬甲式喱士晚裝長裙踏上紅地氈。裙擺配搭不對稱薄紗高衩剪裁大曬修長美腿，頸間戴上閃耀鑽飾頸鏈增添貴氣，在後台外披灰色毛絨外套時氣場十足，自信地向鏡頭揮手甜笑。</p>\n<h2>昔日曾被嘲笑外貌極醜不會成功</h2>\n<p>回顧這段不堪回首欺凌往事，黃紫恩在短片中親自寫下「欺凌過我的人曾說：你好醜，你不會成功的」這句令人心酸說話。她近年憑住爽朗直率性格加上在多檔綜藝節目及劇集中演出成功入屋，吸納大量粉絲支持。這次她勇敢揭開這段曾被指長得很醜暗黑歷史，不僅沒有被過去陰影擊倒，反而將那些冷言冷語轉化為推動自己不斷進步強大力量。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚女大十八變經歷超勵志</h2>\n<p>這段充滿戲劇性蛻變短片曝光後，大批網民紛紛湧入留言區表達支持與讚賞。不少人被她勇敢面對過去態度深深打動，留言表示「真的是女大十八變，太勵志了」、「證明了自信就是最美麗武器」、「從照片就能看出她背後付出多少努力」。大量留言充斥著對她勇敢面對過去的正面評價，大眾普遍關注她以亮麗狀態回應昔日負面聲音的客觀舉動。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666046291598_16557218846b080104d98d3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jojotszyan_1795518917_4037425566067233295_178977472.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666046291598_16557218846b080104d98d3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jojotszyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666219429965_5349862006b08010688ec9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IDI5OkSEFopfZ4Vx-Zo6UE9hEpnw7zPZE9oxVBPaMVQ.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666219429965_5349862006b08010688ec9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jojotszyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666334172299_13156102296b080107aa98c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jojotszyan_1778923792_3898217769314783928_178977472.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666334172299_13156102296b080107aa98c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jojotszyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956866648846168_18437714236b08010947e3f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"N6MVBKmGPl8pfhd9mOcabgSgJO4WGBjaouRbTqLkW04.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956866648846168_18437714236b08010947e3f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jojotszyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666595167275_20280856256b08010a5b6a9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"-krveH9XP_rxW-KN_XUVEJXoWaHFkBKY-YGEcvmBhHI.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666595167275_20280856256b08010a5b6a9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jojotszyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666717942642_6083400836b08010b86c4a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"870104500_17996221731109892_8179393602716665498_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666717942642_6083400836b08010b86c4a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jojotszyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666930383331_5208167446b08010db2be2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jojotszyan_1782213490_3925813746933236849_178977472.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568666930383331_5208167446b08010db2be2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jojotszyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956866709158449_7226304346b08010f877a9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jojotszyan_1768996224_3814939289133848919_178977472.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956866709158449_7226304346b08010f877a9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jojotszyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568667304011874_5393470686b08011166208.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jojotszyan_1757508395_3718572400342859520_178977472.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568667304011874_5393470686b08011166208.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jojotszyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179110016155953245_18237479806ac20501dbe12.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179110016155953245_18237479806ac20501dbe12.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jojotszyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/175550685993351274_83421980468a2e8ac39445.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃紫恩 j2 黃紫恩靠《後生仔》入屋（圖片來源：黃紫恩IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/175550685993351274_83421980468a2e8ac39445.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>黃紫恩靠《後生仔》入屋（圖片來源：黃紫恩IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/175550686149460603_178319192968a2e8ade2c7f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃紫恩 j2 私下活潑好動（圖片來源：黃紫恩IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/175550686149460603_178319192968a2e8ade2c7f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>私下活潑好動（圖片來源：黃紫恩IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:03:53.425276+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1263,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:51:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:20.439131+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:20.439131+00:00","content_hash":"e32676e48d5f36e0accd5d211b8a6bbfbb4f64cafe6e57cd29fe4bf523be1f01","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}